      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Operational data keys [[p0]]can’t[[p1]] begin with the following: [[p2]] , [[p3]] , [[p4]] , [[p5]] , [[p6]] , [[p7]] , [[p8]] , [[p9]] .",
